    "scope": "Akshardham Delhi principal mandir exterior, its mapped waterside stepped platform and approach bridge, plus two mapped flanking forecourt pavilions. Nine domes, twenty quadrangled roof spires, southwest-facing open entrance porches, carved wall rhythms and an elephant plinth identify the specific temple. Distant exhibition halls, gardens, theatre and the full religious campus remain separate native structures.",
