        "date": "2007-11-13 description date",
        "observations": "Current completed oblique exterior: pink sandstone, a hierarchy of round lobed domes, golden finials/flag, stepped quadrangled spires, open carved porches, dense wall bands and elephant figures around the lower plinth."
      },
      {
        "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Akshardham_Delhi_Ricky_W.jpg",
